Any monster wielding a bullwhip can yank your wielded weapon from your
hands.  Horned devils are often generated with a bullwhip.

For wizards, this is generally totally insignificant because they have
the Eye and their starting cloak -- something grabbing Magicbane means
you zap it with magic missile and go pick up Magicbane again, and you
lose curse resistance for a few turns; so corner-case as to be meaningless.

For other classes using Magicbane as a sole source of MR, they need to
be far more aware that bullwhips exist.

